    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_faction_leaderTitle] [asker_nameFull] de [asker_faction_name] precisa de mãos extra para ajudar a [dutyDescription].\n\nPede-te que lhe emprestes [colonistCountToLend] durante [lendForDays] dias.\n\n[willSendShuttle]</li>
    <li>disease->gripe</li>
    <li>disease->peste</li>
    <li>disease->malária</li>
    <li>disease->infeção</li>
    <li>questDescription(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True)->[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction] [asker_nameFull] de [asker_faction_name] precisa de pessoas para ajudar a [dutyRoyalDescription].\n\nPede-te que emprestes [colonistCountToLend] para lhe prestarem serviço durante [lendForDays] dias.\n\n[willSendShuttle]</li>
    <li>colonistCountToLend(colonistsToLendCount==1)->1 colono[minAgeOrOlder]</li>
    <li>colonistCountToLend(colonistsToLendCount>1)->[colonistsToLendCount] colonos[minAgeOrOlder]</li>
    <li>willSendShuttle->[asker_pronoun] enviará um vaivém para recolher [colonists].</li>
    <li>colonists(colonistsToLendCount==1)->o colono</li>
    <li>colonists(colonistsToLendCount>1)->os colonos</li>
    <li>minAgeOrOlder(minAge==0)-></li>
    <li>minAgeOrOlder(minAge>0)-> com [minAge] anos ou mais</li>
    <li>pawnListHaveConjugation(colonistsToLendCount==1)->voltou</li>
    <li>pawnListHaveConjugation(colonistsToLendCount>1)->voltaram</li>
  </PawnLend.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
